{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31081","headline":"送李倍巡官归永乐旧居 · 薛能","name":"送李倍巡官归永乐旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羡君归去五峰前，往往星河实见仙。\n麦壠夏枯成废地，枣枝秋赤近高天。\n山泉饮犊流多变，村酒经蚕味可怜。\n曾约道门终老住，步虚声里寄闲眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}